<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Gencor raised at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gencor raised at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Afica's Gencor was raised to to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;outperform&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note from analyst Peter Davies at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5 rand at 1,755.</p>
<p>Davies said the weakness of the rand was beneficial to all the company's divisions, adding that the company had strong cash reserves and was geared to the aluminium price which had a positive outlook.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
